<title>USA: Philip Morris Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net		    1,773,000		1,565,000</p>
<p> Oper revs	   18,217,000	     17,491,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     2,429,000		2,489,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Philip Morris Cos Inc.</p>
<p>If operating revenues were to exclude operating results from several domestic food businesses that the company divested in 1996, figures would total $18.22 billion for 1997 and $17.42 billion for 1996.</p>
<p>Share and average shares figures have been adjusted for the 1997 Q1 three-for-one-stock split.</p>
</text>
